8. Mandatory product declarations (summary; full texts in docs/legal/)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following must be declared in-app and in releases (canonical short texts:
docs/legal/APP-DISCLOSURE-TEXTS.md):

- AI, not a real person; AI-generated content may be wrong and must be labelled.
- Not medical, psychological, legal or financial advice; consult a real
  professional. No diagnosis, therapy, or guaranteed confidentiality.
- Role-play / emotional-support mode is 18+ only; no virtual partner/relative
  intimacy for minors; no inducing dependency, romance or paid relationship
  unlocks.
- Continuous use: remind the user to take a break every 2 hours; provide easy
  exit, voice/memory controls, and a quiet night mode.
- Crisis: stop role-play and refer to emergency services (110/120), trusted
  people, and professional support (12356 mental-health hotline in China).
- Mods/DLC: every load or modification must re-display this disclaimer and get
  confirmation; authors must keep the declaration in their code/package/README,
  must not remove safety or consent gates, and are responsible for content,
  licensing and provenance. Ordinary data-only packs; no executable code.
- TTS: synthetic voice, may make mistakes, costs/privacy apply, must not be used
  for illegal activity, impersonation or fraud; enabling or changing voice
  settings requires fresh user confirmation; no cloning of unauthorised voices.

